 "remarks": "Not a drive by! Welcome to this bright, spacious 4-5 bedroom, 4.5-bathroom home offering endless possibilities on 1.11 private acres in the highly desirable Newfield area. Featuring hardwood floors throughout, the main level boasts a stunning gourmet granite eat-in kitchen complete with a gas stove, double ovens, and an extra-large center island with seating-perfect for entertaining. The open-concept flow leads through sliders to a spacious deck overlooking a beautiful, private backyard and a sparkling in-ground pool. The expansive dining room is built for grand entertaining, while the living room features a cozy fireplace and its own deck access. A private main-level bedroom with an en-suite bath offers the perfect setup for a second primary suite, home office, or guest quarters. The walkout lower level adds incredible value, featuring a large family room with a fireplace that opens into a full in-law apartment. Complete with a bedroom, a dedicated kitchen area ideal for hosting pool parties, an additional guest bedroom, a full bath, and a separate entrance, this level offers ultimate flexibility. Upstairs, discover the primary suite with a private bath alongside three additional well-appointed bedrooms and a full hall bath. This exceptional property is your perfect escape from city living.",
